#: scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 283abf862e90480edf47e003802443991fa1e4a22f0d5e4acb4c73aeb80c31a7
#. default-sha256: b617c731ee3e63456feed7d62626fb59467240360b4f44faefc13f4293d4a2d3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But as you might expect, the door was locked, and the priest showed no sign of responding to "
"his calls. ⟪k:1⟫The sound of the pouring rain drowned out everything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma come lei potrebbe aspettarsi, Padrone, la porta era chiusa a chiave,⟪k:1⟫e il prete non "
"mostrò alcun segno di vita.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il suono della pioggia battente soffocava tutto il resto."

#: scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaee4548b1543e0d25365e9079b30a8d4d6adfe1671ad257be982b2d8f61148c
